title: 'When Trial Data Portals Move: CSDR Sponsor-Policy Attribution Reproduction Package'
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Moon Hwan
    affiliation: RISU Institute
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
type: software
abstract: 'Scripts and public archive coordinates for independent verification of dated clinical-trial sponsor-policy attribution at ClinicalStudyDataRequest.com. The package checks 15 original HTTP/WARC records and compares three policy-substitution cases with selected historical controls. Exploratory trial-route observations are preserved separately and are not claimed as independently replayed original HTTP captures.'
keywords:
  - clinical trial data sharing
  - Common Crawl
  - WARC
  - policy provenance
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/risu-research/csdr-policy-attribution-repro'
